flowchart TD
  Priority[Shared hauling category order / commit higher-priority work first] --> Offers[Actual remaining idle eligible workers]
  Offers --> Match{Two real workers and finite storage?}
  Match -->|no| Other[Continue lower-priority feasible work]
  Match -->|yes| Promise[One source claim / one warehouse cell promise / two worker handles]
  Promise --> Shelf[Real worker prepares compatible shelf / smoke]
  Shelf --> Queue[Release warehouse standing faces / distinct outside source points]
  Queue --> Aisle[Exclusive aisle / front worker enters before rear worker]
  Aisle --> Ready[Actual grips plus reserved destination stations and long-load route]
  Ready --> Bend[Synchronized existing bend / approved contact window]
  Bend --> Lift[One Ledger JointCarry / one source stock transfer]
  Lift --> Ramp[Measured coupled withdrawal / both workers and load leave ramp]
  Ramp --> Carry[Release aisle only after both clear / retain exclusive joint carry]
  Carry --> Drop[Actual row/deck engagement and put-down]
  Drop --> Receipt[One warehouse deposit and promise consumption]
  Receipt --> Clear[Both workers physically clear / pending duties apply safely]
  Ready -->|reassignment before lift| Exit[Release source claim / rear worker exits first if aboard]
  Carry -->|reassignment| Retain[Finish safe handoff before changing jobs]
  Retain --> Drop
  Carry -->|lost participant| Ground[One retained ground stock / no fabricated receipt]
  Event[Actual intent, stock or access event wakes blocked operation] -.-> Queue
  Event -.-> Ready
  View[Two actual-ID actor views / one shared payload / no inventory authority] -.-> Lift
